{"name":"Wave Goodbye","hex":"#9aaab6","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"wave goodbye","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To say goodbye by means of a handwave.","Synonym of say goodbye (“cease to have, or have to do, something”)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wave_goodbye"}],"entries":[{"title":"Nine Inch Nails","blocks":[{"text":"Nine Inch Nails, commonly abbreviated as NIN, is an American industrial rock band formed by singer, songwriter, multi-instrumentalist, and producer Trent Reznor in 1988 in Cleveland, Ohio. Reznor was the sole permanent member of the band until his frequent collaborator, English musician Atticus Ross, became an official member in 2016. The band's debut album, Pretty Hate Machine (1989), was released via TVT Records. After disagreements with TVT over how the album would be promoted, the band signed with Interscope Records and released the EP Broken (1992), followed by the albums The Downward Spiral (1994) and The Fragile (1999)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Nine_Inch_Nails_-_20.06.2022_-_O2_Apollo_Manchester.jpg/330px-Nine_Inch_Nails_-_20.06.2022_-_O2_Apollo_Manchester.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nine_Inch_Nails"},{"title":"Wave","blocks":[{"text":"In mathematics and physical science, a wave is a propagating dynamic disturbance of one or more quantities. Periodic waves oscillate repeatedly about an equilibrium (resting) value at some frequency. When the entire waveform moves in one direction, it is said to be a traveling wave; by contrast, a pair of identical superimposed periodic waves traveling in opposite directions makes a standing wave. In a standing wave, the amplitude of vibration has nulls at some positions where the wave amplitude appears smaller or even zero."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/2006-01-14_Surface_waves.jpg/330px-2006-01-14_Surface_waves.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wave"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Trent_Reznor_Lollapalooza_1991.jpg/330px-Trent_Reznor_Lollapalooza_1991.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Trent_Reznor_Lollapalooza_1991.jpg/330px-Trent_Reznor_Lollapalooza_1991.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Reznor during the 1991 Lollapalooza festival","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATrent_Reznor_Lollapalooza_1991.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Trent_Reznor_Self-Destruct.jpg/500px-Trent_Reznor_Self-Destruct.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Trent_Reznor_Self-Destruct.jpg/500px-Trent_Reznor_Self-Destruct.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Reznor performing during the Self-Destruct tour, c. 1994–1995","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATrent_Reznor_Self-Destruct.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/Nine_Inch_Nails_Moline_03.jpg/500px-Nine_Inch_Nails_Moline_03.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/Nine_Inch_Nails_Moline_03.jpg/1280px-Nine_Inch_Nails_Moline_03.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/Nine_Inch_Nails_Moline_03.jpg/500px-Nine_Inch_Nails_Moline_03.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Live performance during the Live: With Teeth tour in 2006","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A